---
interface Props { href: string; language?: 'ko' | 'en'; }
const { href, language = 'ko' } = Astro.props;
const ko = language === 'ko';
---

<aside class="lab-link-card" aria-label={ko ? '관련 데이터 실험' : 'Related data experiment'}>
  <div class="lab-link-card__mark" aria-hidden="true">↗</div>
  <div class="lab-link-card__body">
    <p class="lab-link-card__kicker">CONCEPT → DATA</p>
    <h3>{ko ? '삼성전자 사례를 직접 실험해 보기' : 'Run the Samsung case as a data experiment'}</h3>
    <p>{ko ? '원글의 질문을 실제 종가와 비교 기간으로 다시 읽어봅니다. 발표 전 기간, 시장 대비 수익률, 예상치 실험을 직접 바꿔볼 수 있습니다.' : 'Take the question from this essay back to the data. Change the pre-event window, market comparator, and assumed estimate yourself.'}</p>
    <a href={href}>{ko ? '실적 발표일 데이터 Lab 열기' : 'Open the earnings-day data Lab'} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </div>
</aside>

<style>
  .lab-link-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:1rem;margin:2rem 0;padding:1.15rem 1.25rem;border:1px solid #d5dfd1;border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f3f7f1,#fbfcfa);box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(31,62,39,.06)}
  .lab-link-card__mark{display:grid;place-items:center;width:2.3rem;height:2.3rem;border-radius:10px;background:#234c32;color:#fff;font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700}
  .lab-link-card__body{min-width:0}.lab-link-card__kicker{margin:0 0 .35rem;color:#52705a;font:700 .68rem/1.2 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.12em}.lab-link-card h3{margin:0;font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.3}.lab-link-card p:not(.lab-link-card__kicker){margin:.45rem 0 .8rem;color:#5b665c;font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.6}.lab-link-card a{color:#234c32;font-weight:700;text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:3px}.lab-link-card a:hover{color:#102e1b}.lab-link-card a span{display:inline-block;margin-left:.2rem;transition:transform .2s ease}.lab-link-card a:hover span{transform:translateX(3px)}
  @media(max-width:540px){.lab-link-card{padding:1rem;gap:.75rem}.lab-link-card h3{font-size:1.05rem}.lab-link-card p:not(.lab-link-card__kicker){font-size:.88rem}}
</style>
